Let's create a automation where user have to send a GET or POST request in order to get the news of the following city he or she entered.

# webhook node
1. open n8n
2. create new workflow
3. click on '+' button and search for webhook node
4. configure node :-
method : POST
path : news-bot
5. test this node , click on execute workflow
6. open cmd and write following
curl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook-test/news-bot -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"message\":\"Jaipur news\"}"


