# gnews with http node
1. first go to website gnews.io
2. sign up and get a api key , copy that
3. come to n8n again
4. click on '+' and search for http request 
5. configure node :- 
method :  get 
url : https://gnews.io/api/v4/search?q={{$json.city}}&token=7b8b31ef4e67173085114d33a5d28e28&lang=en
for u , have to change the value after '=' and before '&' , that the api key we get from gnews


# another funtion 
1. click on '+' button
2. click on function in search bar and select js function
3. write code below:-
let articles = $json.articles;

return articles.map(item => {
  return {
    city: $json.city,
    title: item.title,
    description: item.description,
    url: item.url
  };
});


